## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Party Frames
## Author: Devin
## Version: 5.10.0
## Notes: Combat-first party frames built for arena: per-class layers that surface shields, hots, blessings, uptime, dispels, and CC status at a glance. Priests get the Power Word: Shield board with Renew and Prayer of Mending on a swept strip; Mages get health/mana rows with total-absorb tracking, decurse and CC alarms, and a personal upkeep banner; Druids get the hot board — Rejuvenation, Regrowth and Lifebloom stacks per ally, curse and poison alarms, and a form/cooldown banner; Paladins get the blessing board — one blessing slot per ally carrying the blessing you assigned them (per class, overridable per player, reassigned by clicking the slot itself), counted only when YOU cast it so a second paladin never makes a naked teammate look handled, with Greater satisfying the single; plus the Hands as a swept strip, the Forbearance lockout as a drain, and an aura/seal/cooldown banner whose aura and seal segments are click-to-switch. Every class gets a permanent ally-buff strip with per-buff tracking, and an opt-in urgency advisor that reddens a missing buff only when the target's situation and the enemy comp say it is actually costing you. Allies' pets get full ally rows too (on by default), so they can be buffed and healed like anyone else.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Shield_06
## SavedVariables: CommanderPartyFramesDB
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events

